The off-chain execution path debt-clamps the collateral WAD, converts it to token decimals, refreshes the quote, and sends that WAD as `maxAmount`; that lines up with the on-chain exact-fill check. I’m now checking the raw quote-due math and provider validators to see if any floor/ceil mismatch remains outside the contract backstop.
