codex
For 1inch, the deploy script guard is conservative: it refuses `dex.oneInch` because no automated allowlist derivation exists. The remaining risk is manual enablement: runtime preflight checks the 1inch router and router registry, but I don’t see an on-chain allowlist reconciliation for `OneInchAggregatorKeeperTaker` comparable to LI.FI/Sushi.
