I found a second deployment/config asymmetry: `OneInchAggregatorKeeperTaker` enforces the same on-chain target/spender/selector allowlists, but the runtime route preflight for `ONEINCH` does not reconcile those allowlists at all. The deployment script refuses to automate 1inch, so this is a manual-enable liveness risk rather than an automatic script bug.
